## Welcome

This knowledge base is built with **Markdoc** for content authoring and **Keystatic** for visual editing.

## Features

- Rich content with custom components
- Visual editing through Keystatic
- Markdoc-powered rendering
- GitHub-based content storage

{% Callout type="tip" title="Getting Started" %}
Head to the `/keystatic` route to start editing content visually.
{% /Callout %}

## Content Types

You can create articles with:

- Styled images with multiple placement options
- Video embeds (YouTube, Vimeo, self-hosted)
- Callouts and quotes
- Image galleries
- Code blocks with syntax highlighting
- Tables and more

{% Callout type="info" title="Markdoc Syntax" %}
All content is written in Markdoc format, which extends Markdown with custom tags and components.
{% /Callout %}
